-- Tags: [measured] / [observed] / [inferred] / [uncertain] follow the analysis record.
--
-- Used by the production client (StarterPlayerScripts.Client.*) and server (ServerScriptService.Server.WeaponServer):
-- Viewmodel, Fire, HipFire, ADS, Recoil, Sway, Muzzle, Reloads, Hud.
-- The foundation test blaster still uses Combat.CombatConfig.
-- Screen-space numbers are fractions of screen height; convert with the camera FOV at runtime.

local M4 = {
